OL,6,     FNada Tawfik speaks to Catherine
OL,7,     FRussell, executive director of
OL,8,     FUNICEF, about threats to children
OL,9,     Fhow to protect the most
OL,10,     Fvulnerable, and the growing impact
OL,11,     Fof global aid cuts.
